    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">神祕莫測的呋嚕藉噴氣的推動力在幽暗地域中游蕩，並因其噴氣的聲音而得名。它會將自己的想法反映在色彩的變化上。淺粉是愉悅，深藍是悲傷，綠色是好奇，深紅則是憤怒。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑體\"><em><strong>聰明而博學Intelligent and Wise。</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">呋嚕通過心靈感應來進行交流。雖然外表像水母，但呋嚕卻是非常聰明而又博學的生物。它們掌握了許多異常先進的宗教、哲學、數學以及其他稀奇古怪的知識。<br />呋嚕對於周圍生物的情感變化非常敏感。如果某個生物的思考發人深省，呋嚕便可以藉此輕易的找到它。但假如面前的生物在考慮邪惡的事情，呋嚕會逃之夭夭。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑體\"><em><strong>心靈虹吸Psionic Siphons。</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">呋嚕通過吸取靈能生物的精神能量餵養自己。在奪心魔、底棲魔魚、吉斯洋基人和吉斯澤雷人的社羣附近都有機會發現潛伏的呋嚕。呋嚕以消極寄生的方式只吸食它們所需程度的精神能量。因而絕大多數被吸食生物不會感到任何不適。<br />消化心靈能量會揭示能量來源者的思想和情緒。由於呋嚕吸食的大多是邪惡生物，使得它們總是被迫接受一些會玷污其純潔心靈的想法、情緒和渴望。當呋嚕遇上心地善良的冒險者時，它會急切的想與冒險者分享這些邪惡祕密，以期消滅邪惡能量的源頭，哪怕這意味着不得不重新尋找食物來源。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑體\"><em><strong>呋嚕社羣Flumph Society。</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">呋嚕們各司其職的生活在一起，組成一種複雜而有組織的社羣稱爲修會cloister。每個呋嚕在社羣內都以自己的方式作出貢獻，其和諧程度甚至根本不需要任何個體出任領導。</span></p><p>The mysterious flumphs drift through the Underdark, propelled through the air by the jets whose sound gives them their name. A flumph glows faintly, reflecting its moods in its color. Soft pink means it is amused, deep blue is sadness, green expresses curiosity, and crimson is anger.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Intelligent and Wise\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Intelligent and Wise.</span> Flumphs communicate telepathically. Though they resemble jellyfish, flumphs are sentient beings of great intelligence and wisdom, possessing advanced knowledge of religion, philosophy, mathematics, and countless other subjects.</p><p>Flumphs are sensitive to the emotional states of nearby creatures. If a creature's thoughts suggest goodness, a flumph seeks that creature out. When facing creatures that exude evil, a flumph flees.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Psionic Siphons\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Psionic Siphons.</span> Flumphs feed by siphoning mental energy from psionic creatures, and they can be found lurking near communities of mind flayers, aboleths, githyanki, and githzerai. As passive parasites, they take only the mental energy they need, and most creatures feel no loss or discomfort from such feeding.</p><p>Consuming psionic energy reveals the thoughts and emotions of the creatures on which the flumphs feed. Since so many of those creatures are evil, flumphs are often subjected to thoughts, emotions, and hungers that sicken their pure nature. When flumphs encounter good-hearted adventurers, they eagerly share the dark secrets they have learned in the hopes of casting down their evil sources of energy, even if doing so means they must seek out new sources of nourishment.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Flumph Society\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Flumph Society.</span> Flumphs live in complex and organized groups called cloisters, within which each flumph has a place and purpose. These harmonious groupings have no need for leaders, since all flumphs contribute in their own way</p></div></div></div>",
        "public": ""
      },
