    {
      "_id": "XJ3Iqu8FbpCnYAGK",
      "name": "惡臭噴濺Stench Spray",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "135",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">以呋嚕爲原點的</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">15</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺錐狀範圍內，每個生物必須進行一次</span> [[/save ability=dex dc=10]]<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">的敏捷豁免，豁免失敗者將濺上一種污臭的液體。被濺上液體的生物在</span> [[/r 1d4]]<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">小時內都將散發出臭氣。在臭味持續時間內，該生物陷入</span>&amp;Reference[condition=poisoned]<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">狀態，該生物周邊</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺內的其他生物也會因此陷入</span>&amp;Reference[condition=poisoned]<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">。該生物可以通過進行一次短休，以水、酒精或醋來洗掉這些臭味。</span></p><p>Each creature in a 15-foot cone originating from the flumph must succeed on a [[/save ability=dex dc=10]] saving throw or be coated in a foul-smelling liquid. A coated creature exudes a horrible stench for [[/r 1d4]] hours. The coated creature is &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned] as long as the stench lasts, and other creatures are &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned] while with in 5 feet of the coated creature. A creature can remove the stench on itself by using a short rest to bathe in water, alcohol, or vinegar.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
