    {
      "_id": "ApzyI378ygKeKwnt",
      "name": "倒地缺陷Prone Deficiency",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "135",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">呋嚕應擊陷入</span> &amp;Reference[condition=prone]<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">時擲一次骰。如果骰值爲奇數，則呋嚕就會翻轉過來並陷入</span> &amp;Reference[condition=incapacitated]<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">狀態。呋嚕在每個自己的回合結束時可以進行一次</span>[[/save ability=dex dc=10]]的豁免<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">，豁免成功則終止該狀態。</span></p></div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>If the flumph is knocked &amp;Reference[condition=prone], roll a die. On an odd result, the flumph lands upside-down and is &amp;Reference[condition=incapacitated]. At the end of each of its turns, the flumph can make a [[/save ability=dex dc=10]] saving throw, righting itself and ending the &amp;Reference[condition=incapacitated] condition if it succeeds.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
